    "detailed_description": "A point-and-click time-management game where cats rule and laundry is big business. Laundrocorp's cattorneys are pressuring your fledgling laundromat to fold. Manage your hectic laundry business, unlock customers, and level up your cat to defeat Laundrocorp and bring honor back to your family. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660090/extras/e6e4846cf85bd009d87ed5e677b4f381.poster.avif?t=1739469166\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660090/extras/e6e4846cf85bd009d87ed5e677b4f381.webm?t=1739469166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660090/extras/e6e4846cf85bd009d87ed5e677b4f381.mp4?t=1739469166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Early Feedback for Laundry Simulator from Seattle Indies Expo 2021 judges:</strong><br><i>\u201cLove, love, love it!\u201d</i><br><i>\u201cSuch a cute, interesting, and surprisingly addicting game\u201d</i><br><i>\u201cBeautifully paced, nicely balanced with just the right amount of ramp up and anxiety to keep me guessing\u201d</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Cat Professions</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660090/extras/2721a2fc04eab5f1c21cd633903be7c8.poster.avif?t=1739469166\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660090/extras/2721a2fc04eab5f1c21cd633903be7c8.webm?t=1739469166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660090/extras/2721a2fc04eab5f1c21cd633903be7c8.mp4?t=1739469166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Level up your cat, Snowball, into an expert accattant, cattorney, or even just a better cat. Use accattant skills to earn money faster, cattorney skills to shield against lawsuits and fines, and cat skills for increasing customer patience.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unlockable Customers</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660090/extras/2c66cb7682f5fdc786cb52ce44ddcc56.poster.avif?t=1739469166\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660090/extras/2c66cb7682f5fdc786cb52ce44ddcc56.webm?t=1739469166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660090/extras/2c66cb7682f5fdc786cb52ce44ddcc56.mp4?t=1739469166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Unlock unique customer types, and discover their attributes and special abilities. For some, perfectly washed and folded laundry delivered quickly will mean positive buffs. For others, a single mistake could ruin your day. Learn which customers you can\u2019t afford to ignore, which will help you out if treated right, and how to strategically stack buffs.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Store Upgrades</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660090/extras/9492b505cb11e8fad4c37bfdbe2e3697.poster.avif?t=1739469166\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660090/extras/9492b505cb11e8fad4c37bfdbe2e3697.webm?t=1739469166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660090/extras/9492b505cb11e8fad4c37bfdbe2e3697.mp4?t=1739469166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Buy more and better machines to do even more laundry. Purchase cat toys to distract your cat from sleeping on laundry, or buy an industrial de-linter to deal with the naptime shedding.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story Rich</h2>You are the great-grandchild to the late Landon Washerman, laundry legend. Before he grew ill, no one could beat Landon. Learn about your family past, discover hidden lore, and maybe even find out how Landon became ill in the first place...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Cattorney, accattant, and cat skill trees<br></li><li>Unlockable customers with special abilities<br></li><li>Store upgrades<br></li><li>Cattorney battles<br></li><li>Laundry-themed periodical with tips and tricks<br></li><li>Deep history with family secrets<br></li><li>Pettable cat!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "A point-and-click time-management game where cats rule and laundry is big business. Laundrocorp's cattorneys are pressuring your fledgling laundromat to fold. Manage your hectic laundry business, unlock customers, and level up your cat to defeat Laundrocorp and bring honor back to your family. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660090/extras/e6e4846cf85bd009d87ed5e677b4f381.poster.avif?t=1739469166\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660090/extras/e6e4846cf85bd009d87ed5e677b4f381.webm?t=1739469166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660090/extras/e6e4846cf85bd009d87ed5e677b4f381.mp4?t=1739469166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Early Feedback for Laundry Simulator from Seattle Indies Expo 2021 judges:</strong><br><i>\u201cLove, love, love it!\u201d</i><br><i>\u201cSuch a cute, interesting, and surprisingly addicting game\u201d</i><br><i>\u201cBeautifully paced, nicely balanced with just the right amount of ramp up and anxiety to keep me guessing\u201d</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Cat Professions</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660090/extras/2721a2fc04eab5f1c21cd633903be7c8.poster.avif?t=1739469166\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660090/extras/2721a2fc04eab5f1c21cd633903be7c8.webm?t=1739469166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660090/extras/2721a2fc04eab5f1c21cd633903be7c8.mp4?t=1739469166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Level up your cat, Snowball, into an expert accattant, cattorney, or even just a better 