tory Rich</h2>You are the great-grandchild to the late Landon Washerman, laundry legend. Before he grew ill, no one could beat Landon. Learn about your family past, discover hidden lore, and maybe even find out how Landon became ill in the first place...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Cattorney, accattant, and cat skill trees<br></li><li>Unlockable customers with special abilities<br></li><li>Store upgrades<br></li><li>Cattorney battles<br></li><li>Laundry-themed periodical with tips and tricks<br></li><li>Deep history with family secrets<br></li><li>Pettable cat!</li></ul>",
